WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.048 --> 00:00:08.952
Over 80% of middle-aged women deal with this, so there's no need to feel embarrassed or worried.

2
00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:13.560
We offer a tailored solution based on how thin the crown area is.

3
00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:21.216
For early-stage thinning, we use special products like hair fibers or root shadow powder to reduce the scalp's color contrast and visually fill it in,

4
00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:29.400
and for more advanced thinning with visible scalp, we secure a lightweight crown hairpiece underneath to create seamless, full volume.

5
00:00:29.736 --> 00:00:36.504
With an artist's careful touch, it looks exactly like your own hair — in photos and in person — so you can relax.

6
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:43.872
Thinning at the crown is a common concern among wedding parents, so a shop that specializes in wedding parents will have a range of solutions ready.

7
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:47.520
That's why you need to mention it ahead of time.

8
00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:54.432
Being upfront about it when you book or at the prior consultation lets us prepare the right special hairpiece for your condition in advance,

9
00:00:54.768 --> 00:01:00.120
and lets us assign a veteran artist who's especially skilled with hairpieces.

10
00:01:00.456 --> 00:01:07.176
Preparing ahead of time is what makes a flawless, secure style possible even under the tight schedule on the wedding day.

11
00:01:07.512 --> 00:01:10.920
A well-prepared wedding parent is the one who shines on the day.
